            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm thinking of making some lemon-based desserts for an upcoming dinner party. Do you have any recommendations for a good lemon curd recipe or any tips on using it as a filling for cakes and tarts?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 1,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156350156120000-600"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "What are some good ways to incorporate lemon zest into my baking? I've heard it can add a lot of depth to desserts, but I'm not sure how to use it effectively."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156492453503000-643"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's really helpful, thanks! I've been experimenting with different types of flour lately, and I've been wondering if there's a particular type of flour that's best suited for lemon-based desserts. Would bread flour or all-purpose flour work better for a lemon cake or tart crust?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156528299925000-650"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I've had a lot of success with honey in lemon desserts, and I think it's because of the way the flavors complement each other. The rich, caramel-like flavor of the honey pairs really well with the brightness of the lemon. I've also found that using honey in combination with other sweeteners, like granulated sugar, helps to balance out the flavor and texture of the dessert."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 6,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157040569679000-773"
          }
